{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Ai RADAR 是一款結合 Google Places 資料的旅遊探索應用，讓你身處陌生國家或鄰近城市時，都能即時找出周邊值得前往的地點。無論是旅客、觀光客還是本地居民，都可透過它搜尋景點、餐廳、醫院、自動櫃員機與酒店等資訊。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>三種檢視模式探索周邊</h2>\n<p>Ai RADAR 提供三種檢視方式：地圖模式掌握整體周邊概況，擴增實境（AR）模式以實時畫面呈現附近地點，清單模式方便快速瀏覽與比較。應用同時顯示實時位置並提供路線導航。每個地點均附服務時間、相片、聯絡資料、評論、評分與路線指引，一個畫面即可掌握完整資訊。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-185-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-186-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-187-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-188-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-189-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-190-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Ai RADAR</li>\n<li>應用類別：Travel</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-09T20:18:23.315702+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":314,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}